 ## Usage
 
 ```python
-from accounts.reset import request_reset
+from accounts.reset import complete_reset, request_reset
 
+# 1. The user asks for a reset. Deliver the returned token to them out of band
+#    (for example by email to the address on the account); never return it to the requester.
 token = request_reset("user@example.com")
+
+# 2. The user submits the token with a new password.
+if complete_reset("user@example.com", token, "new password"):
